NOT FOR NAVIGATION.

This software and its outputs are advisory only. They are not a substitute for
official nautical charts, official tide and current tables, or prudent
seamanship. Chart, depth, tide, current and weather data may be incomplete,
outdated, or wrong. Routing output is derived from weather forecasts, which are
uncertain by nature. The skipper remains solely responsible for the safety of
the vessel and everyone aboard.

